# Cloudflare Workers Assets redirects
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pre-launch URL consolidation. Three classes of redirect:
#   1. Old "space-named" redesign URLs → new kebab-case URLs
#   2. Deleted legacy static pages    → closest redesign equivalent
#   3. Folded-in old paths            → their consolidated destination
# Every URL gets both the clean form and the .html form for completeness.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- 1. Old space-form URLs → new kebab URLs ------------------------------
/Padua%20Portal                              /padua-portal                301
/Padua%20Portal.html                         /padua-portal.html           301
/Padua%20Portal%20-%20Platforms              /padua-portal-platforms      301
/Padua%20Portal%20-%20Platforms.html         /padua-portal-platforms.html 301
/Who%20we%20are                              /who-we-are                  301
/Who%20we%20are.html                         /who-we-are.html             301
/News%20%26%20Insights                       /news-insights               301
/News%20%26%20Insights.html                  /news-insights.html          301
/Transition%20Management                     /transition-management       301
/Transition%20Management.html                /transition-management.html  301

# --- 2. Deleted legacy static pages → redesign equivalents ---------------
/advisers-licensees                          /padua-portal                301
/advisers-licensees.html                     /padua-portal.html           301
/product-providers                           /padua-portal-platforms      301
